### Nach Kategorien im Zeitverlauf


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
n_action_type_per_month <-
  n_action_type |>
  select(nr, idvisit, category) |>
  ungroup() |>
  left_join(time_visit_wday |> ungroup()) |>
  select(-c(dow, hour, nr)) |>
  drop_na() |>
